WEBVTT

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.677
Open the agent and click Test assistant

00:00:04.677 --> 00:00:12.210
Three ways to test: Phone call, Web call, Live chat

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.668
Choose the caller number: test or your own

00:00:16.668 --> 00:00:21.556
Enter a callee number; verified ones are in the list

00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:27.382
Fill in variables (optional)

00:00:27.382 --> 00:00:32.319
Smart formatter cleans up the name before the call

00:00:32.319 --> 00:00:34.534
cURL copies the same request for your backend

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:42.345
A new callee number? Verify it once by WhatsApp code

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:44.347
The call is placed; status updates live

00:00:44.347 --> 00:00:51.634
Call details lists the variables sent

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:54.241
When it ends, review the call in Logs
